{"3372090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach", "steam_appid": 3372090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>• Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely against sinister entities <br>• Uncover the truth through recovered logs, security footage, and the haunting remains of the base's personnel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE INFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Confront hostile entities that are controlled by a mysterious biological force<br>• Experience dynamic horror that adapts to your actions and decisions<br>• Solve environmental puzzles while avoiding detection by creatures that hunt through light and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique blend of psychological and biological horror<br>• Atmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>• Strategic resource management<br>• Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>• Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Major Axel Vex, a veteran of Extraterrestrial Incident Response, dispatched to investigate a distress signal from Cengona Base - an  underground research facility on a distant exoplanet. What begins as a routine investigation quickly spirals into a desperate battle for survival against an entity that turns both mind and matter against you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DEPTHS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Navigate through 26 unique sectors of a massive underground base, each with its own dangers and secrets<br>• Manage your resources and choose your battles wisely against sinister entities <br>• Uncover the truth through recovered logs, security footage, and the haunting remains of the base's personnel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/8232a444aa9240a804c98310bdb97d20.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE INFECTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Confront hostile entities that are controlled by a mysterious biological force<br>• Experience dynamic horror that adapts to your actions and decisions<br>• Solve environmental puzzles while avoiding detection by creatures that hunt through light and movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/bb7b2254ad75b2b33ddafaf9b7390fc5.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Unique blend of psychological and biological horror<br>• Atmospheric survival horror set in a claustrophobic underground facility<br>• Strategic resource management<br>• Immersive sound design that heightens tension and aids survival<br>• Rich narrative told through environmental storytelling</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.poster.avif?t=1785493666\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.webm?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/extras/9b99d11611b052a74f602648d471a413.mp4?t=1785493666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌿 <strong>Can you resist the breach?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach is a game designed by Tayfun Tuna and developed by Cenk Bilgin. It represents our vision of a new era in psychological survival horror. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong> This game contains scenes of intense horror, violence, and psychological distress. Player discretion is advised.</p>", "short_description": "Step into the boots of Major Axel Vex in this survival horror descent into deep space. You embark on a mission to investigate a distress signal coming from Cengona Base. What starts off as a simple mission quickly turns into a terrifying, action-packed fight for survival.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Polish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“It doesn’t aim to replace those classics; instead, it offers a smaller, more limited, and rougher experience that is nonetheless surprisingly engaging.”<br>75 – Vandal<br><br>“HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach may not have the polished quality of million-dollar AAA games, but it definitely has soul and character.”<br>70 – IGN Türkiye<br><br>“HELL OF FEAR: Mind Breach successfully manages to bring us the intensity of survival games, along with the horror expected from titles like Dead Space.”<br>80 – Softpedia<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/eb702def4f73451ef99c2b5dbaa3ca55018a1318/header.jpg?t=1785493666", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/52622aaeeab4a5346b05901b166a3e91848737ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785493666", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372090/52622aaeeab4a5346b05901b166a3e91848737ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785493666", "website": "http://tayfuntuna.com.tr/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> I